<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?><rss version="2.0"><channel><title>Bing: site:pcgamer.com "little sister" AI</title><link>http://www.bing.com:80/search?q=site%3apcgamer.com+%22little+sister%22+AI</link><description>Search results</description><image><url>http://www.bing.com:80/s/a/rsslogo.gif</url><title>site:pcgamer.com "little sister" AI</title><link>http://www.bing.com:80/search?q=site%3apcgamer.com+%22little+sister%22+AI</link></image><copyright>Copyright © 2026 Microsoft. All rights reserved. These XML results may not be used, reproduced or transmitted in any manner or for any purpose other than rendering Bing results within an RSS aggregator for your personal, non-commercial use. Any other use of these results requires express written permission from Microsoft Corporation. By accessing this web page or using these results in any manner whatsoever, you agree to be bound by the foregoing restrictions.</copyright><item><title>Little Caesars® | Best Value Delivery &amp; Carryout</title><link>https://littlecaesars.com/en-us/</link><description>Order HOT-N-READY® pizzas, Crazy Bread®, and more from Little Caesars® online for delivery or carryout.</description><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 08:46:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>LITTLE Definition &amp; Meaning - Merriam-Webster</title><link>https://www.merriam-webster.com/dictionary/little</link><description>small, little, diminutive, minute, tiny, miniature mean noticeably below average in size. small and little are often interchangeable, but small applies more to relative size determined by capacity, value, number.</description><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 02:12:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>LITTLE | English meaning - Cambridge Dictionary</title><link>https://dictionary.cambridge.org/dictionary/english/little</link><description>LITTLE definition: 1. small in size or amount: 2. a small amount of food or drink: 3. a present that is not of great…. Learn more.</description><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 20:39:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Little (film) - Wikipedia</title><link>https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Little_(film)</link><description>Little is a 2019 American fantasy comedy film directed and co-written by Tina Gordon. It stars Regina Hall, Issa Rae and Marsai Martin, and follows an overbearing boss who is transformed into the teenage version of herself.</description><pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 14:59:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Little - Official Trailer 1 (Universal Pictures) HD</title><link>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Dk6jGQXx3o0</link><description>Little is an irreverent new comedy about the price of success, the power of sisterhood and having a second chance to grow up — and glow up — right.</description><pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 12:06:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Little (2019) - Stream Free | Tubi</title><link>https://tubitv.com/movies/100009613/little</link><description>After waking up in her 13-year-old body before a pivotal presentation, a fierce tech mogul must rely on her wits and assistant to get through the day.</description><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 06:59:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>LITTLE Definition &amp; Meaning | Dictionary.com</title><link>https://www.dictionary.com/browse/little</link><description>LITTLE definition: small in size; not big; not large; tiny. See examples of little used in a sentence.</description><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 00:04:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>LITTLE Synonyms: 615 Similar and Opposite Words - Merriam-Webster</title><link>https://www.merriam-webster.com/thesaurus/little</link><description>Some common synonyms of little are diminutive, miniature, minute, small, and tiny. While all these words mean "noticeably below average in size," little is more absolute in implication often carrying the idea of petiteness, pettiness, insignificance, or immaturity.</description><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 04:21:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Little - Definition, Meaning &amp; Synonyms | Vocabulary.com</title><link>https://www.vocabulary.com/dictionary/little</link><description>Anything small, brief, young, or unimportant can be described as little. If you live in a little cottage, it means your house is very small, and quite possibly adorable.</description><pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 03:12:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Little Mexico Restaurants, Tucson Arizona, Little Mexico Restaurant ...</title><link>https://littlemexico-tucson.com/</link><description>Little Mexico Restaurants are two of Tucson's favorite authentic Mexican Food Restaurants. They are family owned and operated by the Palomarez/ Estrada families. All of their food is prepared on-site including the tamales!</description><pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 03:39:00 GMT</pubDate></item></channel></rss>